# H5P working dirs (local dev only). Anchored with `**/` on purpose: the API
# runs with `apps/api` as its CWD, so the default `./h5p/temporary-storage`
# lands at `apps/api/h5p/`, which a repo-root-anchored pattern does not match.
**/h5p/temporary-storage/
**/h5p/content/

# Agent loop working files: plans and per-issue state are scratch, not history.
.agent/
